<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-027" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-027-wangyuanchu-anmin" source-id="s-nanqishu-027-wangyuanchu-anmin-ws1508012">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-027-wangyuanchu-anmin:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">先是宋世亡命<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangyuanchu-anmin:p001:m0006" ref="7u6_d9k_zzx">王元初</persName>聚黨六合山僣號，自云垂手過膝。州部討不能擒，積十餘年。<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangyuanchu-anmin:p001:m0036" ref="4xf_x1f_vsg">安民</persName>遣軍偵候，生禽<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangyuanchu-anmin:p001:m0045" ref="7u6_d9k_zzx">元初</persName>，斬建康市。</p>
</text>
